# Licensed third-party standards text (PRA-6702)
# ISO/IEC 27001:2022 delivered by Ben is a licensed document. It must live in
# storage/ untracked: the bundle excludes storage/, but a git remote would
# redistribute anything tracked here. The pre-existing ISO/IEC 42001:2023 pair
# is already tracked and is unaffected by this rule.
storage/ISO_IEC_27001*
storage/ISO_IEC_27002*
storage/*27001*
storage/*27002*

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
